Package: civicaccess
Type: Package
Title: Tract-Level Access Measures and Composite Indices for Civic Infrastructure
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: c(
    person("Jubin J.", "Cheruvelil", email = "jcheruve@nyaahealth.org", role = c("aut", "cre")),
    person("Petal", "Grower", email = "pgrower@nyaahealth.org", role = "aut"),
    person("Nyaa Health Services LLC", role = c("cph", "fnd")))
Description: Package-style, fully parameterized functions for building
    census-tract measures of access to civic infrastructure. Includes address
    geocoding and tract assignment with match-quality flags, enhanced two-step
    floating catchment area (E2SFCA) access scores with Gaussian distance decay
    and location-specific catchments, indicator normalization and composite
    index construction, Monte Carlo rank uncertainty for index specification
    choices, and survey-weighted helpers for validating an index against
    respondent data. Examples and tests use synthetic data only.
